# Variables a release refuses to start without, one per line; `A|B` where
# either of two will do. Copied into the manifest's `config.required`
# (ARCHITECTURE.md, "Server deployment", "The manifest"), where the updater
# holds a release that names a variable the operator's environment file lacks.
# Keep this in step with README.md, "Configuration": a new required variable
# added without a default belongs here, and usually also bumps deploy/EPOCH.
# Variables compose sets for the orchestrator itself (DATABASE_URL,
# DOCKER_HOST, DATA_DIR) are not listed.
PUBLIC_URL
JWT_SECRET
POSTGRES_USER
POSTGRES_PASSWORD
POSTGRES_DB
ENGINE_SOCKET_HOST
DATA_DIR_HOST
SECRETS_MASTER_KEYS|SECRETS_MASTER_KEY_FILE
GIT_BOT_NAME
GIT_BOT_EMAIL
